<title>SPAIN: Spain's Bankinter cuts prime rate.</title>
<headline>Spain's Bankinter cuts prime rate.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish bank Bankinter said on Friday it cut its prime rate to 5.75 percent from 6.00 percent after the Bank of Spain cut its key money market rate 25 basis point to 5.75 percent.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
